<a href="https://www.newswire.com/news/big-book-accepting-bitcoin-for-nfl-title-game-wagers-with-same-day-20173408">The online service Big Book</a> is announcing the launch of an unprecedented Bitcoin Sportsbook experience that offers live wagering of the NFL Championship game with the surging cryptocurrency. According to the creators of the one-of-a-kind service, the most significant advantage for users is not having to worry about chargebacks from large financial institutions.

In addition, the ability to wager in Bitcoin gives larger players an advantage by avoiding the limitation of dealing with a maximum withdrawal amount set by mainstream banks of fiat currencies. Live betting is available online to all signed-up members for pre-game and in-game action on the highly anticipated showdown between top-seeded New England and Philadelphia.

The current spread has Philadelphia as a 4.5-point underdog, but the playing public has heavily favored the Eagles and has since moved the line a whole point since the opening wagers were placed. The online "<a href="https://www.bigbook.ag/">Sportsbook Bitcoin</a>" platform also supports live game betting during major events and other live action for other major sports.

In addition to live sports bets, Big Book also supports a diversity of online casino games with jackpots and high payouts all on a mobile-friendly online platform. There is, besides, an online Racebook available that offers same-day Bitcoin payouts. All players can run online, using fast and secure servers that don't require a download.

